| Isolated variable | `ContainerTypeValidate::_internal_convert_variant` only |
| Build | `scons platform=macos target=editor tests=yes vulkan_sdk_path=~/dev/libs/MoltenVK -j10` |
| Compiler | Apple clang 21.0.0 |
| Machine | Apple M1 Max, macOS 26.6.2 |
| Protocol | binaries alternated, 9 rounds each |
| Per-round value | median of in-run reps |
| Table value | median of the 9 rounds |
| Ratio | base / patched; above 1.00 means the patch is faster |
| Reps per round | `max(5, 2000000 / n)` |

